 controle e o comércio internacional de animais."}, "institution": {"en-us": "World Organisation for Animal Health (WOAH)", "pt-br": "Organização Mundial da Saúde Animal (OIE)"}, "doc_citation": {"en-us": "World Organisation for Animal Health. (2025). Manual of Diagnostic Tests and Vaccines for Terrestrial Animals (10th ed.). WOAH. https://doi.org/10.20506/woah.3729", "pt-br": "World Organisation for Animal Health. (2025). Manual of Diagnostic Tests and Vaccines for Terrestrial Animals (10th ed.). WOAH. https://doi.org/10.20506/woah.3729"}}, {"id": 20, "url": "https://doi.org/10.1787/9789264242791-en", "date": "2015-07-28", "slug": "oecd-test-no-435-2015-07-28-in-vitro-membrane-barrier-test-method-for-skin-corrosion-o", "categories": ["method_protocol", "regulation"], "description": {"en-us": "Compilation of OECD Test Guidelines for the testing of chemicals, including in vitro methods for skin corrosion, skin sensitisation, immunotoxicity, and cytochrome P450 induction.", "pt-br": "Compilation of OECD Test Guidelines for the testing of chemicals, including in vitro methods for skin corrosion, skin sensitisation, immunotoxicity, and cytochrome P450 induction."}, "institution": {"en-us": "Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development (OECD)", "pt-br": "Organização para a Cooperação e Desenvolvimento Econômico (OCDE)"}, "doc_citation": {"en-us": "OECD (2015), Test No. 435: In Vitro Membrane Barrier Test Method for Skin Corrosion, OECD Guidelines for the Testing of Chemicals, Section 4, OECD Publishing, Paris,", "pt-br": "OECD (2015), Test No. 435: In Vitro Membrane Barrier Test Method for Skin Corrosion, OECD Guidelines for the Testing of Chemicals, Section 4, OECD Publishing, Paris,"}}, {"id": 9, "url": "https://doi.org/10.1787/0d603916-en", "date": "2024-06-25", "slug": "oecd-test-no-492b-2024-06-25-reconstructed-human-cornea-like-epithelium", "categories": ["method_protocol", "regulation"], "description": {"en-us": "This Test Guideline describes an in vitro