encialmente hereditárias no material genético."}, "external_oht_codes": ["70", "71"]}, {"id": 24, "code": "2.5", "name": {"en-us": "Reproductive and developmental effects", "pt-br": "Efeitos reprodutivos e do desenvolvimento"}, "slug": "reproductive-developmental-effects", "active": true, "parent_id": 7, "created_at": "2026-08-15T02:49:55.733994+00:00", "sort_order": 24, "updated_at": "2026-08-15T02:49:55.733994+00:00", "description": {"en-us": "Adverse effects on reproduction, fertility, pregnancy or development of offspring.", "pt-br": "Efeitos adversos sobre reprodução, fertilidade, gestação ou desenvolvimento da descendência."}, "external_oht_codes": ["73", "74"]}, {"id": 25, "code": "2.5.1", "name": {"en-us": "Reproductive toxicity", "pt-br": "Toxicidade reprodutiva"}, "slug": "reproductive-toxicity", "active": true, "parent_id": 24, "created_at": "2026-08-15T02:49:55.733994+00:00", "sort_order": 25, "updated_at": "2026-08-15T02:49:55.733994+00:00", "description": {"en-us": "Adverse effects on sexual function, fertility, pregnancy or reproductive performance.", "pt-br": "Efeitos adversos sobre função sexual, fertilidade, gestação ou desempenho reprodutivo."}, "external_oht_codes": ["73"]}, {"id": 27, "code": "2.6", "name": {"en-us": "Other health effects", "pt-br": "Outros efeitos sobre a saúde"}, "slug": "other-health-effects", "active": true, "parent_id": 7, "created_at": "2026-08-15T02:49:55.733994+00:00", "sort_order": 27, "updated_at": "2026-08-15T02:49:55.733994+00:00", "description": {"en-us": "Human-health effect domains not classified under the preceding groups.", "pt-br": "Domínios de efeitos sobre a saúde humana não classificados nos grupos anteriores."}, "external_oht_codes": []}, {"id": 28, "code": "2.6.1", "name": {"en-us": "Carcinogenicity", "pt-br": "Carcinogenicidade"}, "slug": "carcinogenicity", "active": true, "parent_id": 27, "created_at": "2026-08-15T02:49:55.733994+00:00", "sort_order": 28, "updated_at": "2026-08-15T02:49:55.733994+00:00",